# Input for make run / make test (sdk/tools/inputscript.py). Time 0 = "basic ..." typed.
# BASIC opens its console and the 320 x 200 graphics window: the title
3000 shot
# any key starts
+100 x
# move the basket with the arrow keys (STICK(0): 4 pixels a frame while one is held)
+1500 {left}{left}{left}
+1500 {right}{right}{right}{right}{right}
+2500 shot
# Esc stops the program ("Break in N")
+500 {esc}
+1500 shot
